  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The objective of this PhD project is to check for the presence of thermal refuges in two rivers located in different permafrost conditions. Other objectives are characterizing the groundwater contribution to the river heat budget and hydraulics to better understand the temperature evolution and to anticipate changes and predict the probable effects on fish habitats."
